                                "example_id": "5d0165fa-024a-4190-8d0c-427580b55110",
                                "sense_id": "d0c5d6d7-5665-3a80-a2b4-03fad39b41e2",
                                "text": "So their discussion is tantamount to nondiscussion. This is the first reason why there is no use (in having a parliament)..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "db5d0d17-47f9-469c-b52e-60a59e1ceb56",
                                "sense_id": "d0c5d6d7-5665-3a80-a2b4-03fad39b41e2",
                                "text": "Without recognition of the importance of balancing, discussions quickly deteriorate into nondiscussions; they become instead assertions by each side..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f75fb1eb-8f5f-49ce-8a2d-ab10c192d7ef",
                                "sense_id": "d0c5d6d7-5665-3a80-a2b4-03fad39b41e2",
                                "text": "Farther up his rear end, the nondiscussion turned to environmentalism: Save the Earth!"
                            }
